OL,3,GNEWSAReform cancels debate on freedom
OL,4,Aof speech as Senedd boycott continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK has withdrawn its plan for a
OL,7,Fdebate on freedom of speech in the
OL,8,FSenedd, as its boycott of the
OL,9,Fparliament continues.
OL,11,FThe party had tabled the motion last
OL,12,Fweek, the day after its member Joe
OL,13,FMartin was banned from speaking in the
OL,14,FSenedd for remarks described by the
OL,15,Fparliament's presiding officer as
OL,16,F"unnecessarily provocative and
OL,17,Fdeliberately offensive".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
