OL,3,GNEWSAReform cancels debate on freedom
OL,4,Aof speech as Senedd boycott continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe motion was cancelled hours before
OL,7,Fthe debate was due to take place, and
OL,8,Fits party members remained absent from
OL,9,Fthe Senedd chamber for most of the day
OL,10,Fon Wednesday.
OL,12,FA Reform spokesman said the boycott was
OL,13,F"ongoing", but did not comment on the
OL,14,Fdebate.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
